---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Features"
  description="Comprehensive features for MCP server discovery, security testing, monitoring, and management. Aran MCP Sentinel provides automated discovery, OWASP compliance checking, real-time monitoring, and enterprise-grade security testing for Model Context Protocol deployments."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="container mx-auto px-4 py-20">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6">Features</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-primary-light mb-12">
          Comprehensive tooling for managing and securing Model Context Protocol deployments. Aran MCP Sentinel provides everything you need to discover, monitor, secure, and manage your MCP infrastructure.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-12">
          <!-- Feature 1: Discovery -->
          <div id="discovery" class="bg-white border-4 border-black p-8 shadow-brutal scroll-mt-20">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Server Discovery and Catalog</h2>
            <p class="text-primary-light mb-4">
              Automatically discover MCP endpoints and services across your network. Build a comprehensive catalog of available MCP servers, tools, and resources with version tracking and compatibility management.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-primary-light ml-4 mb-4">
              <li>Automated network scanning and endpoint detection</li>
              <li>Automatic registration of discovered MCP servers</li>
              <li>Version tracking and compatibility management</li>
              <li>Service health monitoring and status tracking</li>
              <li>Resource and tool cataloging</li>
              <li>Metadata extraction and indexing</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-background-alt border-2 border-black p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-primary-light">
                <strong>Use Case:</strong> Automatically discover all MCP servers in your infrastructure without manual configuration. Maintain an up-to-date catalog of available tools and resources.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 2: Security -->
          <div id="security" class="bg-white border-4 border-black p-8 shadow-brutal scroll-mt-20">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Security Testing and Analysis</h2>
            <p class="text-primary-light mb-4">
              Comprehensive security testing suite with automated vulnerability assessment and OWASP MCP Top 10 compliance checking. Real-time threat detection with risk scoring and remediation recommendations.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-primary-light ml-4 mb-4">
              <li>OWASP MCP Top 10 compliance checking</li>
              <li>Prompt injection detection and prevention</li>
              <li>Tool poisoning vulnerability scanning</li>
              <li>Automated vulnerability assessment</li>
              <li>Risk scoring and prioritization</li>
              <li>Remediation recommendations</li>
              <li>Security policy enforcement</li>
              <li>Compliance reporting</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-background-alt border-2 border-black p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-primary-light">
                <strong>Use Case:</strong> Ensure all MCP servers comply with security best practices. Detect and remediate vulnerabilities before they become security incidents.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 3: Monitoring -->
          <div id="monitoring" class="bg-white border-4 border-black p-8 shadow-brutal scroll-mt-20">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Health Monitoring and Alerting</h2>
            <p class="text-primary-light mb-4">
              Continuous uptime and performance monitoring with real-time alerting. Track response times, availability metrics, and historical trend analysis.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-primary-light ml-4 mb-4">
              <li>Real-time health checks and status monitoring</li>
              <li>Performance metrics tracking (response time, throughput)</li>
              <li>Alert management and notification system</li>
              <li>Historical analytics and trend analysis</li>
              <li>Uptime tracking and SLA monitoring</li>
              <li>Custom alert rules and thresholds</li>
              <li>Integration with existing monitoring systems</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-background-alt border-2 border-black p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-primary-light">
                <strong>Use Case:</strong> Monitor all MCP servers for availability and performance. Get instant alerts when servers go down or performance degrades.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 4: Documentation -->
          <div class="bg-white border-4 border-black p-8 shadow-brutal">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Interactive Documentation</h2>
            <p class="text-primary-light mb-4">
              Swagger-like API documentation for MCP endpoints with tool specifications, usage examples, and integration guides. Auto-generated from discovered servers.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-primary-light ml-4 mb-4">
              <li>API endpoint documentation with interactive testing</li>
              <li>Tool and resource specifications</li>
              <li>Code snippets and usage examples</li>
              <li>Versioned documentation history</li>
              <li>Search and discovery of available tools</li>
              <li>Integration guides and best practices</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-background-alt border-2 border-black p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-primary-light">
                <strong>Use Case:</strong> Provide self-service documentation for developers. Enable teams to discover and use available MCP tools without manual documentation.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 5: Deployment -->
          <div class="bg-white border-4 border-black p-8 shadow-brutal">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Enterprise Deployment Management</h2>
            <p class="text-primary-light mb-4">
              Secure configuration templates, deployment best practices, environment validation, and rollback procedures for production deployments.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-primary-light ml-4 mb-4">
              <li>Configuration templates and best practices</li>
              <li>Deployment automation and orchestration</li>
              <li>Environment validation and testing</li>
              <li>Rollback and recovery procedures</li>
              <li>Multi-environment support (dev, staging, prod)</li>
              <li>Configuration drift detection</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-background-alt border-2 border-black p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-primary-light">
                <strong>Use Case:</strong> Standardize MCP server deployments across environments. Ensure consistent configuration and enable quick rollbacks when needed.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 6: API -->
          <div class="bg-white border-4 border-black p-8 shadow-brutal">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">RESTful API</h2>
            <p class="text-primary-light mb-4">
              Comprehensive REST API for programmatic access to all platform features. Integrate Aran MCP Sentinel with your existing tools and workflows.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-primary-light ml-4 mb-4">
              <li>RESTful API with OpenAPI specification</li>
              <li>Authentication and authorization</li>
              <li>Webhook support for real-time events</li>
              <li>Rate limiting and throttling</li>
              <li>API versioning</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bg-background-alt border-2 border-black p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-primary-light">
                <strong>Use Case:</strong> Integrate MCP server management into your CI/CD pipelines, monitoring systems, and automation tools.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="mt-12 bg-accent border-4 border-black p-8 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 text-white">Ready to Get Started?</h2>
          <p class="text-white mb-6">
            Start securing your MCP infrastructure today with Aran MCP Sentinel.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap">
            <a 
              href="/docs" 
              class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-primary font-bold shadow-brutal hover:shadow-brutal-sm transition-all"
            >
              View Documentation
            </a>
            <a 
              href="https://github.com/adhit-r/aran-mcp" 
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-8 py-4 border-4 border-white text-white font-bold hover:bg-white hover:text-primary transition-colors"
            >
              View on GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
